<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Enquiries and pipeline</p>
      <h1>A solar CRM that follows the enquiry all the way to the job.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__lead">Capture every enquiry with the details a solar sale depends on, assign it, log every call, and know exactly who follows up next. When the customer says yes, the enquiry carries its history straight into survey, quotation and delivery.</p>
      <div class="hero__ctas">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/demo/">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline btn--lg" href="#features">See what it does</a>
      </div>
      <p class="definition"><strong>What does the enquiries module do?</strong> It holds every solar enquiry in one pipeline with roof, bill and project details, an owner, a next follow-up date and a full call and activity history, so no lead depends on one person&rsquo;s phone or memory.</p>
    </div>

