      <p class="eyebrow">Referrals</p>
      <h2 id="ref-h">Every referral reviewed before it reaches the pipeline.</h2>
      <p>Channel partners and your own staff can submit referrals. Your team reviews each one, checks it for duplicates, declines it with a reason or converts it into an enquiry. A partner can see where each of their referrals stands.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>Referral numbers and a clear review status</li>
        <li>Duplicate check before conversion</li>
        <li>Decline reason and manager notes saved</li>
        <li>Commission status tracked for each referral</li>
